[  247.8s] **ladder**: I took B's ladder: `[full_or_floor, next_business_day]`, `[full_or_floor, deadline]`, `[floor, deadline]`. Rule 26 sets the steps: "1 | `past_due` on the first business day after today, or on the deadline if that is earlier | all", "2 | `past_due` on the deadline | late", "3 | the floor on the deadline | late". Rule 24, quoted above, swaps in the floor once the customer says the full amount is too much.
